@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Guest
actor Parent
actor Specialist
actor Admin

rectangle "SEN Support Platform" as Platform
database "PostgreSQL\n(candidate relational database)" as Database
cloud "Email delivery service\n(optional; future, not in MVP)" as Email

Guest --> Platform : browse public pages
Guest --> Platform : register / sign in
Parent --> Platform : manage linked child support
Specialist --> Platform : support assigned children
Admin --> Platform : manage accounts and assignments

Platform --> Database : read and persist records
Platform ..> Email : send future account notifications
@enduml
